ed is not  why chris ballard wrote a 25 million  dollar check to fill up rivers  he did that and he signed phillip rivers  to come in to be reunited with frank  wright because  he wanted him to play great in january  this could be philip rivers last ever  january football game so  show me something phillip rivers  let's extend it by around peter because  there's many more we could get to i'm  going to go to russell wilson show me  something russell wilson simply because  we're getting farther and farther away  from those two super bowl appearances he  has a sense of urgency to continue to  build his legacy so many great  quarterbacks out there with one super  bowl win  desperate to get to two he intends to  play for a long time but each year is  one fewer opportunity than he ultimately  will have to get to a super bowl and try  to win it it begins with a game against  a division rival two potential super  bowl caliber teams one is going to get  knocked out and if it's if it's russell  wilson versus john walford  i don't think you want that on your  permanent record that you lost to john  walford peter  at home  at home  uh mike i'll end it with show me  something david montgomery and you know  i know you talked about trubisky but i  just don't have a lot of faith in  mitchell trubisky to play great in the  superdome on sunday afternoon  but i do have faith  in uh in david montgomery who's had  three 100 yard games since thanksgiving  who really has been the bulk of this  offense when push comes to shove and  when needed  uh down the stretch of this season for  the bears  and i think david montgomery holds the  chances of the bears in his hands in  this game you know he's got to make sure  that mitchell trubisky doesn't have a  bunch of third nates he's got to get  yards on first down he's got to find a  way to get five and six yards on first  and second down so that they're not in  bad situations on third down it's a huge  game for david montgomery so show me  something david  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports

